\pard\sb240\sa80{\b\fs24 Helium's !bang list}\par
\pard\sa120 {\f1\fs20 Packages/core/Sources/BrowserCore/Resources/Bangs.tsv} is generated by {\f1\fs20 make bangs} from Helium's bang list, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://services.helium.imput.net/bangs.json"}}{\fldrslt https://services.helium.imput.net/bangs.json}}. The list combines {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://github.com/kagisearch/bangs"}}{\fldrslt Kagi Search's bangs}} with imput's additions. The generated file repeats this licence in its header and ships inside the BrowserCore resource bundle.\par
