\pard\sb240\sa80{\b\fs24 Mozilla Readability}\par
\pard\sa120 Reading mode reads a page's article with Mozilla Readability 0.6.0 ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://github.com/mozilla/readability"}}{\fldrslt https://github.com/mozilla/readability}}), Copyright (c) 2010 Arc90 Inc, under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (Distribution/Licenses/Apache-2.0.txt). Its {\f1\fs20 Readability.js} and {\f1\fs20 Readability-readerable.js} are in {\f1\fs20 Packages/services/Sources/PageReaderClient/Resources/} with their comments and indentation taken out ({\f1\fs20 Scripts/strip_js.py}), beside the package's licence notice, {\f1\fs20 Readability-LICENSE.md}.\par
\pard\sb240\sa80{\b\fs24 Arx Wordmark font}\par
\pard\sa120 {\f1\fs20 Packages/design-system/Sources/AppUI/Resources/Fonts/ArxWordmark-Regular.ttf} is a modified version of Comfortaa, renamed "Arx Wordmark", with its weight axis extended to 1000. Copyright 2011 The Comfortaa Project Authors ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://github.com/alexeiva/comfortaa"}}{\fldrslt https://github.com/alexeiva/comfortaa}}), with Reserved Font Name "Comfortaa". It is licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1. The full licence ships beside the font as {\f1\fs20 ArxWordmark-OFL.txt} and is available at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://openfontlicense.org"}}{\fldrslt https://openfontlicense.org}}.\par
